    "pre_update_notes": "A patch release on top of 2.3.8, for the storefront: the basket preview under the cart button no longer runs off the left of a phone screen, the page numbers look the same on every list, the cart, footer, shipping section and product delivery FAQ now list the carriers that are switched on under Carriers in the admin, and the cart and checkout pages no longer show the scroll-to-top button. There is no database change; nothing in your products, orders, invoices, payments or customers is changed or removed. Update from a single browser tab and leave the update page open until it finishes.",
